  "reviewNotes": [
    "The exact ten-page 2026 Portuguese/English source is retained. Signatures remain blank. Only completion fields and choice markers are editable; printed clauses are not editable.",
    "Provide readable client identification (and spouse/marital regime or corporate representation evidence as applicable), agent identification, land registry/title, caderneta predial, use/construction licence and energy certificate. A combined document packet is accepted; each fact still needs its exact source quotation.",
    "Confirm the contract number/date, transaction, price and wording in both languages, exclusivity, fee, VAT and payment terms explicitly. Never infer those terms from uploaded instructions. The fixed source states six months, automatic renewal and Lisbon signing; this version only accepts dates in 2026.",
    "Identical repeated PDF fields and choice markers are linked. Predefined English translations are separate editable fields; after a downloaded edit, review both languages. Chat corrections regenerate all copies from sourced facts. Downloaded edits do not update the intake.",
    "The source has exceptionally narrow blanks. Values that cannot fit at 7 pt are rejected, never clipped or silently abbreviated. Some full addresses, marital regimes, identity/energy numbers and dates need an approved shorter wording or a revised source template.",
    "Long spouse names and amounts in words can use the labelled continuation fields. Verify that both language columns express the same complete name and amount. For longer agent names, review the separate Portuguese continuation against the English line.",
    "The source retains alternative liens statements, slash-separated party/property descriptions, and optional clause 6 without selection blanks. These printed alternatives need human review before signing. The source also has different registered-office and footer addresses; neither has been changed."
  ],
